        <headline>Flood Advisory issued September 24 at 3:11PM MST until September 24 at 3:15PM MST by NWS Phoenix AZ</headline>
        <description>The Flood Advisory will expire at 315 PM MST this afternoon for a
portion of south central Arizona, including the following area,
Maricopa.

Flood waters have receded. The heavy rain has ended. Flooding is no
longer expected to pose a threat. Please continue to heed remaining
road closures.
</description>
